 out the rest of the season after suffering injuries on Saturday against Syracuse. Viliamu-Asa injured his left knee, while Tucker broke a bone in his lower left leg.","published":"2025-11-24T19:34:36.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/47086854/notre-dame-loses-lb-viliamu-asa-cb-tucker-rest-season","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Notre Dame loses Kyngstonn Viliamu-Asa for rest of season","description":"Notre Dame will be without key linebacker Kyngstonn Viliamu-Asa for the remainder of the season after he suffered a left knee injury vs. Syracuse.","published":"2025-11-23T21:13:43.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/47075836/notre-dame-loses-kyngstonn-viliamu-asa-rest-season","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What rivalries have the biggest stakes? Connelly looks at the end of the season","description":"Among 20 big games, some classic rivalries have fallen down the pecking order.","published":"2026-11-27T12:25:13.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50595179/connelly-rivalry-week-stakes-preview","type":"Story","byline":"Bill Connelly","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Best friends Pat Surtain II, Jaylen Waddle ecstatic about reuniting with Broncos","description":"Surtain and Waddle bonded immediately at Alabama six years ago and have embraced the chance to play together again in Denver on a team with Super Bowl hopes.","published":"2026-11-27T11:00:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50595313/pat-surtain-ii-jaylen-waddle-broncos-alabama-best-friends","type":"Story","byline":"Jeff Legwold","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top DE D.J. Jacobs commits to Miami hours after pulling Ohio State commitment","description":"Five-star defensive end D.J. Jacobs, the No. 2 overall recruit in the 2027 class, committed to Miami on Thursday hours after pulling his commitment from Ohio State.","published":"2026-11-26T22:58:35.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50606746/top-de-recruit-dj-jacobs-commits-miami-hours-decommitting-ohio-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"D.J. Jacobs decommits from Ohio State, sources say, making top DE available again","description":"D.J. Jacobs, the No. 2 overall recruit in the 2027 class, has decommitted from Ohio State, sources told ESPN, with Tennessee, Georgia and Miami among the leading contenders for the five-star defensive end.","published":"2026-11-26T21:21:16.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50606035/sources-de-dj-jacobs-decommits-ohio-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Friday Night Lights,' 'Ted Lasso' top poll ranking 21st-century sports shows","description":"A Seton Hall poll crowns America's favorite modern fictional sports TV series.﻿","published":"2026-11-26T16:01:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/story/_/id/50576889/top-fictional-sports-series-21st-century","type":"Story","byline":"Brianna Williams","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"The oldest grudge in football","description":"When Texas Tech and its brash benefactor bought their way into the college football big time, they were settling an old West Texas score.","published":"2026-11-26T13:12:44.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50427039/texas-tech-puf-cody-campbell","type":"Story","byline":"Dave Wilson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Take a 360-degree look at college football's iconic rivalry trophies","description":"Whether ancient, animal or absurd, college football's rivalry trophies take many shapes.","published":"2026-11-26T13:09:54.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/feature/story/_/id/50371090/college-football-rivalry-trophies","type":"Eticket","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5079748/kyngstonn-viliamu-asa","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kyngstonn_Viliamu-Asa"},"pick":{"pick":31,"round":1,"team":"SF","provisional":true},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Kyngstonn Viliamu-Asa","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kyngstonn_Viliamu-Asa","description":"American football player (born 2006)","touched":"2026-11-26T23:15:22Z","intro":"Kyngstonn Saisola Opele Niupulusu Viliamu-Asa (born March 16, 2006), also known by his initials KVA, is an American college football linebacker for the Notre Dame Fighting Irish.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Viliamu-Asa attended St. John Bosco High School in Bellflower, California. He was a five-star recruit according to Rivals.com."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Viliamu-Asa committed to play college football for the Notre Dame Fighting Irish over offers from Ohio State and USC."}]}}